    "body": "Quick pass (orchestrating session): merges cleanly with main. The whole quick tier was re-run by a separate gate-runner on the final head 2ff63c70: sim 178 passed, motion 495 passed, app 1763 passed, 0 failed (27 min), including the five app binaries that failed mid-way (arc_entry, conformance, fanuc_post, solid_law_goldens, wall_arc_entry); clippy -D warnings clean on motion, sim and app. Body complete. Flagged ready for the full review. This changes arc fitting for every generator, moves goldens (lead-out ends by about 1.4 mm on three contour bore goldens) and changes one gouge law in sim::verify (arcs read at a quarter of the tolerance), so it is under the safety floor: the review runs at the high tier.",
