    "body": "Quick pass (orchestrating session): the review-fix round is pushed (head bb71d19d) with main merged in; the author's full quick gate (sim, motion, app: all ok, 45 min) and clippy on motion, sim and app were green on exactly this head. Flagged ready for a re-review; `needs-rework` stays until that review replaces it. The body now states the verdict flip in plain words (reading arcs at a quarter of the tolerance turns some former gouges into passes and some former passes into gouges) and `verify_arc_reading` pins both sides against the true distance. This PR changes a gouge law and arc fitting for every generator: a high-tier review is owed before merge.",
