    "body": "Review round 4 (head fd795165), B1 fixed:\n\n- Outside Area mode, law (b) reads an arc at the union of its chord joints at the whole tolerance and at the quarter (`crates/sim/src/verify/section.rs`, `segments`). Every old conviction stands; Area mode is unchanged.\n- Pinned by `verify_arc_reading::boundary_mode_keeps_the_old_joints_so_a_sharp_vertex_on_one_stays_convicted`: the reviewer's case (r 200 arc over 0.048 rad, 3 old and 5 new chords, a sharp island vertex on the old joint at 0.016 rad). Clearances 3.94, 3.95 and 3.98 are convicted; 3.995 and 4.0 stay clean. The test fails with the union switched off.\n- The 4096-gon comment at `verify_arc_reading.rs:108` now says 8.8 um.\n- Gate: sim tests (52 binaries, 427 passed), the 11 named app suites (all passing), and clippy `-D warnings` on sim and app are clean. No golden moved.\n- origin/main 733409bf was merged in first, with no conflicts. The whole-arc reading stays with #905 and the lead-out note with #862.\n\nThe PR stays a draft.\n",
